# 🚀 Day 24 – Business Strategy Report & Growth Planning

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 24 focused on transforming a validated startup idea into a complete business strategy. Using Claude AI, I analyzed business viability, revenue opportunities, customer acquisition channels, competitive positioning, and investor readiness.

The goal was to determine whether the startup has the potential to become a sustainable and scalable business.

---

# 💡 Startup Overview

### Startup Idea
AI-Powered Career Success Platform

A platform that helps job seekers:
- Optimize resumes for ATS systems
- Prepare for interviews using AI
- Discover relevant job opportunities
- Track applications and career progress

### Problem Being Solved
- ATS resume rejection
- Low interview callback rates
- Poor interview preparation
- Time-consuming manual job applications

### Target Customers
- Fresh Graduates
- Students
- Early Career Professionals

### Target Market
Global

---

# 📊 Executive Summary

The startup addresses a large and growing problem faced by millions of job seekers worldwide. By combining resume optimization, interview preparation, and job discovery into a single AI-powered platform, the product can provide measurable value to users.

The biggest success factor is not product features but customer acquisition and distribution.

