# 🎓 Key Learnings

- Distribution is more important than features.
- Revenue matters more than vanity metrics.
- Customer validation reduces startup risk.
- First 100 users are critical for feedback.
- Strong positioning creates competitive advantage.
- Sustainable businesses focus on customer value.

